cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite these texts, cite this repository and the printed PTS edition
  (volume and page). The corrections are recorded, with their sources, in
  corrections.json.
type: dataset
title: "pts-gretil-ng: PTS Pali texts from GRETIL, proofread"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible build of the Pali Text Society editions as given by GRETIL
  (digital input by the Dhammakaya Foundation), with proofreading corrections
  against the scans of the printed editions marked in the text, and
  corrections of the editions published by the PTS (Cone, Jackson, Pruitt)
  marked on the words concerned but not applied.
authors:
  - family-names: Contreras
    given-names: Jorge
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jorgecaa/pts-gretil-ng"
url: "https://jorgecaa.github.io/pts-gretil-ng/"
keywords:
  - Pali
  - Tipitaka
  - Pali Text Society
  - GRETIL
